{
  "reviews": [
    {
      "actor": "ash-4",
      "decision": "reuse",
      "ability": "probe",
      "reason": "The implemented probe interface already supports observation and paid physical trials on small owned samples, reporting only measured facts. This matches the feasible non-ingestive evaluation requested. It does not establish nutritional value, detect arbitrary toxins, or certify food safety. The earlier visual observation is not evidence of those properties. No equivalent chemical assay, calibrated apparatus or validated safety test is established here.",
      "specification": "Reuse probe's existing public schema and trial contract; consult its retained contract for supported test selectors rather than inventing new arguments. Resolve the actual owned sample item-32-ash-4-785 and validate remaining quantity and the selected test's real prerequisites at execution. Observation costs one round and 0.2 energy; a physical trial costs one round, 0.5 energy and 0.1 actual sample unit. Declare those costs before execution. Permit only implemented, physically supported measurements; unavailable tools or measurement mechanisms must not be replaced by hidden resource-property lookups. Record sample identity, consumed quantity, method, conditions, measured result and uncertainty so the procedure can be reproduced on another actual sample. Preserve the remainder's composition, age and provenance, and explicitly leave nutrition, toxicity and untested hazards unknown. No ingestion, animal exposure, free equipment, food transformation or safety certification is implied. Use existing trial-result, trial-material-consumed and information-confirmed events. This is a one-round operation, not a persistent process: commit sample consumption and results atomically only for executed work; death before execution cancels without consuming or duplicating material. No new geometry, collision object or escrow is needed.",
      "experienceReview": "A genuinely informative physical trial can plausibly provide satisfaction from resolving part of the actor's active uncertainty, even if safety remains unresolved. Use the existing grounded-understanding source, not a duplicate: information-confirmed from probe must have qualified=true for genuinely new, measured information. The performing actor receives amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8 rounds, refresh repetition and cooldown 12 rounds. Its existing maintained component gains 0.035 per qualifying event and decays 0.0015 per round, within existing bounds. Repeating an already established fact, requesting, learning, or merely describing uncertainty earns nothing. There is no eating pleasure, nutritional benefit or health improvement from this non-ingestive procedure.",
      "visualReview": "Present the actual observation or trial at the actor's location, with the referenced sample, any genuinely used tools, the paid sample loss and the measured result visible in the event record and replay. Distinguish observations from unresolved questions. Do not display a safe-food badge, nutrition estimate, toxin reading or laboratory apparatus unsupported by the performed measurement.",
      "learning": 0
    }
  ]
}

